"Rage Tower" DEMO Version 0.0.03 - Update

Here are the main changes made:

Fixed again the issue where the camera would freeze;

Fixed again the issue where the player could get stuck in walls;

The game demo may still have some minor issues, and we are actively working to resolve them.

[img src="{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/45700180/1731f44c58b49f93859301cdd8b1fa1b0a32015f.png"]

"Rage Tower" Version 0.0.02 - Update 

Here are the main changes made:

Fixed the issue where the camera would freeze;

Fixed the issue where the player could get stuck in walls;

Fixed game freezing during dialogues;

Re-adjusted the layout of some levels;

Sped up the player respawn animation, with an option to quickly skip the death screen.

The game demo may still have some minor issues, and we are actively working to resolve them.
